### Playtest: a seeded 3-player game through two battles.
# Start the server with `mise run server`, then run the requests top to bottom in IntelliJ.
# Seed 42 deals: anna 4 Horde + 2 Iron, ben 4 Horde + 2 Wood, cleo 4 Horde + 2 Iron.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a game for 3 players; anna hosts
POST {{host}}/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "players": 3, "host": "anna", "seed": 42 }

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.gameId); %}

### ben joins
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ben" }

### cleo joins — the game is full and turn 1 starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "cleo" }

### anna's view: BUILD_UP, pot 1, her hand, available actions
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=anna

### ── Turn 1: build-up ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### anna upgrades a Horde into a Bow (Horde + Iron)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "BOW" }

### ben upgrades a Horde into a Shield (Horde + Wood)
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "into": "SHIELD" }

### anna is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/ready

### ben is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/ready

### cleo is ready — the battle starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/ready

### ── Turn 1: battle (anna and ben tie at strength 2, the pot rolls over) ──

### anna commits 2 Horde and keeps her Bow back
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 2 }

### ben commits 2 Horde and keeps his Shield back
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 2 }

### cleo sits this one out — the battle resolves
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/army
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ben's view: battle 1 in the log with no winner; turn 2 with a pot of 2
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=ben

### ── Turn 2: build-up (no upgrades) ──────────────────────────────

### anna is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/ready

### ben is ready
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/ready

### cleo is ready — the battle starts
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/ready

### ── Turn 2: battle (anna 2+2=4, ben's Shield faces a Bow: 2+1=3, cleo 1) ──

### anna commits 2 Horde and her Bow
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/anna/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 2, "BOW": 1 }

### ben commits his Shield and 1 Horde
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/ben/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "SHIELD": 1, "HORDE": 1 }

### cleo commits 1 Horde — the battle resolves
POST {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}/players/cleo/army
Content-Type: application/json

{ "HORDE": 1 }

### anna's view: battle 2 won by anna with the double pot (2 VP); turn 3 with a pot of 1
GET {{host}}/games/{{gameId}}?player=anna
